2 CONT # I. E. S. Edwards, ed. (1975). ''Cambridge Ancient History'', Volume 2, Part 2, ''History of the Middle East and the Aegean Region, c. 1380-1000 BC''. Cambridge University Press. pp. 32, 275.
2 CONT # A. K. Grayson (1972).'' Assyrian Royal Inscriptions'', Volume 1. Otto Harrassowitz. pp. 54–57, 58, 67.
