0 @N6000000002187614308@ NOTE Arsames
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Arsames was King of Persia, but while still alive gave up the thone to Cyrus II of Persia. Arsames was father of Hystaspes and would live to see his grandson become King Darius I of Persia.
